OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir could be up and running
OL,4,Awithin a decade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major new reservoir could be up and
OL,7,Frunning within 10 years, according to
OL,8,Fan update from Anglian Water.
OL,10,FThe Fens Reservoir, planned between
OL,11,FChatteris and Doddington in
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, would supply water to
OL,13,F250,000 homes in the East of England.
OL,15,FThe project is currently in the
OL,16,Fplanning stages, with a fourth public
OL,17,Fconsultation scheduled before
OL,18,Fdevelopers seek final government
OL,19,Fapproval.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
