OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir could be up and running
OL,4,Awithin a decade
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrant Tuffs, the senior policy and
OL,7,Fpublic affairs lead for Anglian Water,
OL,8,Ftold a meeting of Fenland District
OL,9,FCouncil on Monday there would be a
OL,10,F"long construction period" before the
OL,11,Freservoir supplies homes.
